  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1203.50 Multi-colored coating",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1203.50 “Multi-colored coating” means a coating which exhibits more than one color when applied, but which is packaged in a single container and applied in a single coat.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
